@startuml
title Order data movement - data flow diagram

' Scope: Order data movement
' Evidence:
' - src/routes/orders.ts
' - src/order/OrderService.ts
' Assumptions:
' - Approximated using components, data stores, and directional data flows.

actor "Customer" as Customer
component "Create Order" <<process>> as P1
database "Order Database" <<data store>> as D1
component "Payment Provider" <<external entity>> as E1
queue "order.created" <<data flow/store>> as Q1

Customer --> P1 : order details
P1 --> D1 : order record
P1 --> E1 : payment details
E1 --> P1 : authorization result
P1 --> Q1 : order event

@enduml
